  data: {
    LLM: "In Hokom, lead your trumps early to exhaust the opponents' ability to ruff your winning Kings and Aces. In Sun, focus on establishing control through long suits.\n\nWatch the discards. If your partner discards a 7 of Spades, they are likely signals that they have no more Spades. Use this to lead Spades and let them trump in.\n\nThe 'Lock' (Qafel): If you have the best trumps, you can 'lock' the game, meaning trumps cannot be led. This allows you to walk through with your long suit and wipe out the contractor.",
    Player: "In Hokom, lead your trumps early to exhaust the opponents' ability to ruff your winning Kings and Aces. In Sun, focus on establishing control through long suits.\n\nWatch the discards. If your partner discards a 7 of Spades, they are likely signals that they have no more Spades. Use this to lead Spades and let them trump in.\n\nThe 'Lock' (Qafel): If you have the best trumps, you can 'lock' the game, meaning trumps cannot be led. This allows you to walk through with your long suit and wipe out the contractor.",
